From: Shayne Chen <shayne.chen@mediatek.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jun 2022 19:46:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: testmode: rework init registers and add ZWDFS

Testmode extensions: firmware-based RX counters and a chip-specific
register backup/restore list for ATE mode, plus ZWDFS validation
(background chain parking on an operator-selected channel) and IPI
histogram sampling with channel load reporting.

Squash of the following MediaTek commits:
- wifi: mt76: testmode: rework testmode init registers
  (Shayne Chen, 2022-06-06)
- wifi: mt76: testmode: add ZWDFS test mode support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2022-10-27)
